cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this creator or the assets it bakes, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "A character creator on ANNY"
authors:
  - name: "weft"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
abstract: >-
  A Godot project that lets a person set the 317 shape weights of the canonical ANNY
  fixture (eleven phenotype axes, 52 facial actions under FACS action-unit numbers, 254
  local dials) and export a rigged, expressive human as pure-data glTF and VRM 1.0.
  Joints follow the shape through the hm08 JointCubes helper geometry. Decision record
  is RFD 2253 in weftspun/request-for-discussion.
references:
